    "detailed_description": "<strong>RE-DISCOVER THE CAPE OF STORMS</strong><br><br>Play as Bartolomeu Dias and re-discover the <strong>Cape of Storms</strong>! Adamastor has finally captured you, and now you must explore multiple locations to escape! Unravel puzzles, fight his minions, and most importantly, search for the truth!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2232420/extras/6ec0ff0f73947a09f29647e0cbeafff5.poster.avif?t=1670014796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2232420/extras/6ec0ff0f73947a09f29647e0cbeafff5.webm?t=1670014796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2232420/extras/6ec0ff0f73947a09f29647e0cbeafff5.mp4?t=1670014796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>FIGHT AGAINST ADASMATOR</strong><br><br>Adamastor has sent the Portuguese to his realm! Fight against the nightmares of your crew and escape with Thetis help!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2232420/extras/a04e4913ab255d5c910335e79e1a06dd.poster.avif?t=1670014796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2232420/extras/a04e4913ab255d5c910335e79e1a06dd.webm?t=1670014796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2232420/extras/a04e4913ab255d5c910335e79e1a06dd.mp4?t=1670014796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>YOUR PLAYSTYLE, YOUR ENDING</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2232420/extras/7b7c32f295b40d758813a2390d58c1c7.poster.avif?t=1670014